# 统一行尾策略：仓库内文本文件一律以 LF 存储，避免跨平台提交时出现「整个文件被修改」的假差异
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 专属脚本保留 CRLF，避免 cmd / PowerShell 解析异常
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制资源不做换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
